{MESON "500"}
Haruka<STYLE ID="1"> got off her bike and quickly ducked into the shadow of the bike shed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="2">, what's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"You don't get it? High schoolers are under a stay-at-home order today. If we get spotted, we'll get in trouble, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haruka<STYLE ID="1">'s example </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="なら">guiding</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> us, I and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> both huddled down in the bike shed.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"But </STYLE>Niimura-senpai<STYLE ID="4">, in that case, all the high schoolers who were at the park are getting in trouble?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s retort got no reaction at all from </STYLE>Haruka<STYLE ID="1">.</STYLE><PG>
"The police, in a place like this... What on earth did they come here for?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That'd be door-to-door questioning, wouldn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Oh, right. Door-to-door questioning, huh."<PG>
