<STYLE ID="1">Before long, the patrol car drove off in the direction opposite from us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Without even sounding its siren, it slowly disappeared toward the </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ていじろ">T-intersection</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> at the far end.</STYLE><PG>
