{MESON "500"}
"Door-to-door questioning, huh... Which means they must've come to our place too..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE>Senpai<STYLE ID="4">, you seem awfully bothered by that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
