{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Okaaay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> answered brightly and </STYLE>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">plopped down on the sofa with a whumpf.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, you sit down too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">I slowly sat down.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> turned on the TV without asking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It looked like the midday news was on.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes, we're coming to you live from Motoki-cho."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">They seemed to be reporting on the incident at Central Park.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"According to information we have just received, the victim is believed to be male. However, the victim was found with the skin </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="は">stripped</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> from the entire body, and the victim's identity is still unknown."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Ooh! My deduction hit the mark! Operation successful!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Munch munch..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> cried out happily.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">In her hand, the sakiika I had brought along.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Amazing, how she can be happy hearing about a flayed body...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">On the TV, a personality in the studio and the announcer at the scene were talking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"There's information that the victim was still alive when first found, but is that true?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yes. According to the person who found the body and other witnesses, the victim was still breathing when first found. However, it appears the victim died before the police arrived. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That said, the estimated time of death and the time of discovery almost coincide, so I think it is quite possible that, just as the witnesses say, the victim was still alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">There didn't seem to be anything particularly new.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">No, maybe I should say it just hadn't been announced yet.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯着信1.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "900" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
