{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"............?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It was from a number I didn't know.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">It seemed to be coming from a landline somewhere in town.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">The area code was a familiar number.</STYLE><PG>
