{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, aren't you going to answer?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hm, it's from some number I don't know."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">For a moment I </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ちゅうちょ">hesitated</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to answer, but I took one breath and slowly tapped my smartphone.</STYLE><PG>
