<STYLE ID="2">"Yes... hello?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">, are you getting along with </STYLE>Haruka-chan<STYLE ID="9">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, it's just </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. I wondered who it was."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"My cell's battery died after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">A little while ago, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="9"> called. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">He said it looked like there was an incident over your way, and were you okay."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Ahh, so it made the news in Hokkaido too."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"Well, he was worried, so I let him know the two of us here are both fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, got it, yeah, bye."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
