<STYLE ID="1">She must have called from the phone at her work.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, geez. She never charges it properly..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "300" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">When I looked up, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was standing right in front of me before I knew it.</STYLE>
