<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "2000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">I could see a face on the verge of tears.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">... could you show me the number that called?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? It's this one?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
