{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">The short </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> threw her arms tight around me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">With a strong grip, as if she were clinging to me.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"G-</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">? What's wrong? Huh?"</STYLE>
