<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, it's all right. I'll go too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">I'll be with you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
