<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, no matter what happens... please keep a firm hold on yourself."</STYLE>
